      <div class="about-copy reveal">
        <h1>Meet Mathew</h1>
        <p><strong>I'm Mathew McLean,</strong> and I run TruLeaf Landscapes out of Kangaroo Valley. I've spent 18+ years in horticulture and landscaping, across the Gold Coast, the Mid North Coast and now here.</p>
        <p>I started TruLeaf because I wanted to work with gardens, not against them. Permaculture taught me to look at what a place wants to be — the soil, the water, the aspect, the plants that already want to grow there.</p>
        <p>That's the work I love. I'd rather plant something that's still thriving for you in ten years than something that looks good for a week. And I'd rather quote you honestly for what a job takes than pad it out.</p>
        <p>If there's something outside what I do, I'll point you to a Kangaroo Valley tradesperson I know and trust to do it properly.</p>
        <p>When I'm not working I'm in the garden, or out on the water. I care about how a place feels, not just how it looks on the day we finish.</p>
        <p>We're fully insured, we turn up when we say we will, and we leave the place tidy.</p>
        <a class="txt-link" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
